# User-specific runtime settings — RUNTIME_MUTABLE (F23/F24).
# .claude/settings.json is managed by Claude Desktop on Windows and may be
# absent/recreated between tool calls. The STABLE source of truth is
# templates/settings.json + config/atlas.runtime.expected.yaml, validated by the
# release gate (healthcheck "Expected config"). Tracking the live file caused a
# corrupt test fixture to leak into the repo and break CI — keep it untracked.
.claude/settings.json
